  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Concrete derived SfxBoolItem constructors use literal native Which120/129 and true defaults; independent Clone copies current identity and value without demoting the class.",
    "SwAttrPool registers concrete true defaults, matching native init.cxx. Primitive boolean browser restoration preserves concrete type; invalid/disabled/inherited/direct states remain distinct.",
    "Text Flow creates native concrete items only for changed widgets. Native shell consumes explicitly SET concrete items without materializing unchanged defaults; selected row/whole table scope and one original-owner/cursor/history transaction verified through mounted UI.",
    "Native CreatePages eagerly constructs registered pages, with deferred Reset only when requested. No lazy creation change is justified by this source; eager current page construction retained."
  ],
  "residuals": [
    "Native full shared-frame-format item sets, row keepTogether scalar inversion and table scalar format ownership remain partial.",
    "Full item-instance pooling/refcounts, presentation/localization, SfxBoolItem PutValue/UNO and complete SfxTabPage orchestration remain unverified. No whole-module or metadata-status promotion.",
    "Registered IO/recovery/settings, original-owner identities and all old acceptance assertions preserved. Whole core/browser parity incomplete."
  ]
}
